 Meetings become Teams calls, office talk becomes group chat and group calls. More async communication - not really... Your recent piece about group chats is spot on, but it is not trivial to move away from that once it is the norm. Any experience/ideas how to best approach this?

Traveling around the world, while having a full-time job is not easy. Your time is limited, so you need to do some smart planning to get the most out of your trip.  

